       learn:"", note:"لا يُقبل العمل النهائي المولّد بالذكاء الاصطناعي ما لم تسمح به مراجعة حالية للقواعد. القواعد لم تُنشر بعد."},
     links:[["⏳ " + '<span class="en">Rules: pending</span><span class="ar">القواعد: لم تُنشر</span>',"https://edustream.ae/steam-champions-uae/rules-resources/#art-rules"]]}
  ];
  var AGES = {7:[11,12,13,14], 10:[14,15,16,17], 11:[15,16,17,18], 12:[16,17,18]};

  // language
  var bEn = document.getElementById("b-en"), bAr = document.getElementById("b-ar");
  function L(){ return app.dataset.lang; }
  function setLang(l){
    app.dataset.lang = l; app.setAttribute("dir", l === "ar" ? "rtl" : "ltr"); app.setAttribute("lang", l);
    bEn.setAttribute("aria-pressed", l === "en"); bAr.setAttribute("aria-pressed", l === "ar");
    store("sc-lang", l); renderFinder(); renderPick(); renderToday();
    if (!document.getElementById("out").hidden) build();
  }
  bEn.onclick = function(){ setLang("en"); }; bAr.onclick = function(){ setLang("ar"); };

  // tabs
  var tabs = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[role="tab"]'));
  var ids = tabs.map(function(t){ return t.getAttribute("aria-controls"); });
  function navTop(){ return document.querySelector(".bar").getBoundingClientRect().top + window.scrollY - 2; }
  function show(id, focus, scroll){
    tabs.forEach(function(t){ var on = t.getAttribute("aria-controls") === id; t.setAttribute("aria-selected", on); t.tabIndex = on ? 0 : -1;
      document.getElementById(t.getAttribute("aria-controls")).hidden = !on; if (on && focus) t.focus(); });
    if (scroll) window.scrollTo({top: navTop()});
  }
  tabs.forEach(function(t, i){
    t.onclick = function(){ show(t.getAttribute("aria-controls"), false, true); };
    t.onkeydown = function(e){ var d = e.key === "ArrowRight" ? 1 : e.key === "ArrowLeft" ? -1 : 0; if (L() === "ar") d = -d;
      if (d){ show(ids[(i + d + ids.length) % ids.length], true); e.preventDefault(); } };
  });
  document.querySelectorAll("[data-go]").forEach(function(a){ a.onclick = function(e){ e.preventDefault(); show(a.dataset.go, false, true); }; });

  // finder
  var grade = 10, age = 15, interests = [];
  var ageSel = document.getElementById("age");
  function fillAges(){ ageSel.innerHTML = ""; AGES[grade].forEach(function(a){ var o = document.createElement("option"); o.value = a; o.textContent = a; ageSel.appendChild(o); });
    if (AGES[grade].indexOf(age) < 0) age = AGES[grade][1]; ageSel.value = age; }
  ageSel.onchange = function(){ age = +ageSel.value; renderFinder(); };
  document.querySelectorAll("#gradeSeg button").forEach(function(b){ b.onclick = function(){
    grade = +b.dataset.g; age = AGES[grade][1]; document.querySelectorAll("#gradeSeg button").forEach(function(x){ x.setAttribute("aria-pressed", x === b); }); fillAges(); renderFinder(); }; });
  document.querySelectorAll("#intChips button").forEach(function(b){ b.onclick = function(){
    var i = b.dataset.i, k = interests.indexOf(i); if (k < 0) interests.push(i); else interests.splice(k, 1);
    b.setAttribute("aria-pressed", k < 0); renderFinder(); }; });
  function eligible(c){ return c.grades.indexOf(grade) > -1 && age >= c.ages[0] && age <= c.ages[1]; }
  function esc(s){ return String(s).replace(/[&<>"]/g, function(ch){ return {"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;"}[ch]; }); }
  function renderFinder(){
    var lang = L(), list = C.filter(eligible), box = document.getElementById("comps");
    var lab = lang === "ar" ? {t:"المجموعة", e:"الأهلية", w:"ماذا تفعل", j:"التحكيم", k:"الأدوات", l:"ماذا تتعلم"} : {t:"Team", e:"Eligibility", w:"What you do", j:"Judged on", k:"Kit / tools", l:"You learn"};
    box.innerHTML = list.map(function(c){
      var d = c[lang], match = interests.length === 0 || c.int.some(function(i){ return interests.indexOf(i) > -1; });
      return '<article class="comp' + (match ? '' : ' dim') + '" style="--c:' + c.c + '"><div class="top"><small>' + esc(d.cat) + '</small><h3>' + c.emoji + ' ' + esc(d.name) + '</h3></div>' +
        '<div class="meta"><span>👥 ' + esc(d.team) + '</span><span>🎓 ' + esc(d.elig) + '</span></div>' +
        '<dl><dt>' + lab.w + '</dt><dd>' + esc(d.what) + '</dd><dt>' + lab.j + '</dt><dd>' + esc(d.judge) + '</dd><dt>' + lab.k + '</dt><dd>' + esc(d.kit) + '</dd>' + (d.learn ? '<dt>' + lab.l + '</dt><dd>' + esc(d.learn) + '</dd>' : '') +
        (d.note ? '<dd style="color:#c2410c;font-weight:600">⚠️ ' + esc(d.note) + '</dd>' : '') + '</dl>' +
        '<div class="links">' + c.links.map(function(x){ return '<a class="btn line sm" href="' + x[1] + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener">' + x[0] + ' ↗</a>'; }).join("") +
        '<a class="btn green sm" href="#join" data-pick="' + c.id + '">🚀 ' + (lang === "ar" ? "أريد هذه" : "I want this") + '</a></div></article>';
    }).join("");
    var n = list.length;
    document.getElementById("result").textContent = lang === "ar"
      ? "✅ " + n + " مسابقات متاحة للصف " + grade + "، عمر " + age
      : "✅ " + n + " competitions available for Grade " + grade + ", age " + age;
    box.querySelectorAll("[data-pick]").forEach(function(a){ a.onclick = function(e){ e.preventDefault();
      document.getElementById("grade").value = String(grade); renderPick();
      var cb = document.querySelector('#compPick input[value="' + a.dataset.pick + '"]'); if (cb) cb.checked = true;
      show("join", false, true); }; });
  }

  // timeline "you are here"
  function renderToday(){
    var now = Date.now(), next = null;
    document.querySelectorAll("#tl .pt").forEach(function(p){
      var t = Date.parse(p.dataset.date + "T23:59:59+04:00"); p.classList.remove("done","next");
      if (t < now) p.classList.add("done"); else if (!next){ next = p; p.classList.add("next"); }
    });
    var el = document.getElementById("today");
    if (next){ var days = Math.ceil((Date.parse(next.dataset.date + "T23:59:59+04:00") - now) / 86400000);
      var name = next.querySelector("b ." + L()).textContent;
      el.textContent = L() === "ar" ? "📍 أنت هنا. الخطوة التالية: " + name + " بعد " + days + " يوماً." : "📍 You are here. Next up: " + name + " in " + days + " days."; }
    else el.textContent = "";
  }

  // countdown to registration close: 31 Oct 2026, end of day, Dubai time
  var CLOSE = Date.parse("2026-10-31T23:59:59+04:00");
  function pad(n){ return (n < 10 ? "0" : "") + n; }
  function tick(){
    var ms = CLOSE - Date.now();
    if (ms <= 0){ document.getElementById("cd").innerHTML = '<span class="lbl">🔒 <span class="en">Registration has closed</span><span class="ar">أُغلق التسجيل</span></span>'; return; }
    var s = Math.floor(ms / 1000);
    document.getElementById("d").textContent = Math.floor(s / 86400);
    document.getElementById("h").textContent = pad(Math.floor(s % 86400 / 3600));
    document.getElementById("m").textContent = pad(Math.floor(s % 3600 / 60));
    document.getElementById("s").textContent = pad(s % 60);
    setTimeout(tick, 1000);
  }

  // form
  var gradeSel = document.getElementById("grade");
  function renderPick(){
    var g = +gradeSel.value, box = document.getElementById("compPick"), lang = L();
    var checked = Array.prototype.map.call(box.querySelectorAll("input:checked"), function(i){ return i.value; });
    if (!g){ box.innerHTML = '<span class="hint">' + (lang === "ar" ? "اختر صفك لتظهر المسابقات." : "Choose your grade to see the competitions.") + '</span>'; return; }
    box.innerHTML = C.filter(function(c){ return c.grades.indexOf(g) > -1; }).map(function(c){
      return '<label><input type="checkbox" value="' + c.id + '"' + (checked.indexOf(c.id) > -1 ? " checked" : "") + '>' + c.emoji + ' ' + esc(c[lang].name) + '</label>'; }).join("");
  }
  gradeSel.onchange = renderPick;
  function v(id){ return document.getElementById(id).value.trim(); }
  function chosen(){ return Array.prototype.map.call(document.querySelectorAll("#compPick input:checked"), function(i){ var c = C.filter(function(x){ return x.id === i.value; })[0]; return c[L()].name; }); }
  function talents(){ var ar = L() === "ar"; return Array.prototype.map.call(document.querySelectorAll("#talents input:checked"), function(i){ return ar ? i.dataset.ar : i.value; }); }
  function build(){
    var ar = L() === "ar";
    var T = ar ? {subj:"STEAM Champions – طلب انضمام – ", hi:"مرحباً أستاذ سعد،", intro:"أرغب في الانضمام إلى فريق المدرسة في مسابقة أبطال STEAM الإمارات 2026/2027.", name:"الاسم", cls:"الصف/الشعبة", comp:"المسابقة التي أريدها", tal:"مواهبي", built:"شيء بنيته", idea:"فكرتي للمستقبل الدائري", team:"فريقي", par:"ولي أمري يعلم ويوافق", yes:"نعم", no:"ليس بعد", bye:"شكراً لك،"}
      : {subj:"STEAM Champions – application – ", hi:"Dear Mr. Saad,", intro:"I would like to join the school team for STEAM Champions UAE 2026/2027.", name:"Name", cls:"Grade / class", comp:"Competition I want", tal:"My talents", built:"Something I have built", idea:"My Circular Futures idea", team:"My team", par:"My parent knows and agrees", yes:"Yes", no:"Not yet", bye:"Thank you,"};
    var lines = [T.hi, "", T.intro, "",
      "• " + T.name + ": " + v("name"), "• " + T.cls + ": " + v("grade") + (v("section") ? " – " + v("section") : ""),
      "• " + T.comp + ": " + (chosen().join(ar ? "، " : ", ") || "—"), "• " + T.tal + ": " + (talents().join(ar ? "، " : ", ") || "—"),
      "• " + T.built + ": " + (v("built") || "—"), "• " + T.idea + ": " + (v("idea") || "—")];
    if (v("team")) lines.push("• " + T.team + ":\n  " + v("team").split(/\n+/).join("\n  "));
    lines.push("• " + T.par + ": " + (document.getElementById("parent").checked ? T.yes : T.no), "", T.bye, v("name"));
    var text = lines.join("\n"), msg = document.getElementById("msg");
    msg.value = text; msg.setAttribute("dir", ar ? "rtl" : "ltr");
    document.getElementById("mailto").href = "mailto:" + TEACHER_EMAIL + "?subject=" + encodeURIComponent(T.subj + v("name") + " " + v("grade") + v("section")) + "&body=" + encodeURIComponent(text);
    document.getElementById("out").hidden = false;
  }
  document.getElementById("f").addEventListener("submit", function(e){
    e.preventDefault(); var ar = L() === "ar", miss = [];
    if (!v("name")) miss.push(ar ? "الاسم" : "your name");
    if (!v("grade")) miss.push(ar ? "الصف" : "your grade");
    if (!v("section")) miss.push(ar ? "الشعبة" : "your class");
    if (!chosen().length) miss.push(ar ? "مسابقة واحدة على الأقل" : "at least one competition");
    document.getElementById("err").textContent = miss.length ? "⚠️ " + (ar ? "أكمل: " : "Please add: ") + miss.join(ar ? "، " : ", ") + "." : "";
    if (miss.length) return; build(); document.getElementById("status").textContent = "";
    document.getElementById("out").scrollIntoView({block:"nearest"});
  });
  document.getElementById("copy").onclick = function(){
    var msg = document.getElementById("msg"), st = document.getElementById("status"), ar = L() === "ar";
    function fallback(){ msg.focus(); msg.select(); st.textContent = ar ? "📋 النص محدد، انسخه بـ Ctrl+C." : "📋 Text selected. Press Ctrl+C to copy."; }
    if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) navigator.clipboard.writeText(msg.value).then(function(){ st.textContent = ar ? "✅ تم النسخ! الصقه كتعليق خاص في Google Classroom." : "✅ Copied! Paste it as a private comment in Google Classroom."; }, fallback);
    else fallback();
  };

  // start
  fillAges();
  var h = location.hash.replace("#", "");
  setLang(h === "ar" ? "ar" : (store("sc-lang") || "en"));
  show(ids.indexOf(h) > -1 ? h : "about");
  tick();
})();
